# The .NET Mono runtime is built from a fork of dotnet/runtime kept outside this
# repository.  Its location is taken from the MEADOW_RUNTIME_DIR environment
# variable, or ../runtime (relative to the directory holding build.sh) when
# MEADOW_RUNTIME_DIR is not set.
#
# The runtime build must refuse to run unless that checkout is at the commit
# below.  The tree hash is recorded as well because the branch history has been
# rewritten once (backup/meadow-3.0-pre-cleanup holds the same tree under
# different commit hashes).
#
# To move to a new runtime commit, update both values in the same change.

